/* Scan FlatPack ViewComponents so Tailwind emits their utility classes.
 * Design tokens live in flat_pack/variables (loaded via stylesheet_link_tag).
 * Do not fork --color-fp-* or write a token that points at itself.
 *
 * Shared :root names (host CSS last wins): --color-primary, --color-secondary,
 * --radius-*, --shadow-*, --font-sans. If the host needs a separate primary,
 * use a host-only name such as --my-app-primary. To restyle FlatPack, set
 * --brand-* or --color-primary in a stylesheet loaded after flat_pack/variables:
 *   :root { --brand-hue: 160; --brand-chroma: 0.18; --brand-lightness: 0.52; }
 *
 * Tailwind @layer theme still emits --radius-md: 0.375rem (and --font-sans:
 * ui-sans-serif). Re-set kit radii on unlayered :root — not inside @theme —
 * so rich-text chrome matches kit surfaces. Fallbacks in kit CSS only apply
 * when the token is unset.
 */
@source "<%= source_path %>";

:root {
  --radius-xs: 0.125rem;
  --radius-sm: 0.25rem;
  --radius-md: 0.5rem;
  --radius-lg: 0.75rem;
  --radius-xl: 1.25rem;
  --radius-full: 9999px;
}
